%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: StinkyMoniRevealMc
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh! You must've met the actual {mc}! The one you replaced.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099884709838865
    - rid: 268099884709838866
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I was actually wondering if he was still out there, guess that answers
      my question, ahaha!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099884709838867
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... <NoiseText=1,1>what</NoiseText>...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099884709838868
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm? What's up {mc}-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099884709838869
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099884709838870
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099884709838871
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oops...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099884709838872
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh my God...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: B-b-but-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But if he's {mc}, who am <i>I</i>?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: No, no, no, you <i>are</i> {mc} just... you're just <i>another</i> {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205184
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=1,1>What does that even mean</NoiseText>?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205185
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You <i>just</i> said I replaced that other guy; <NoiseText=1,1>why, how</NoiseText>-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=1,1>Screw it! When, what, and maybe even who are also good
      questions to ask</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And why do <i>you</i> even know anything about this, anyway?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That's uh... well...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I actually tried asking you about it back when you first joined the club,
      and a few times after too, but...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205186
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: It's because none of this is real.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205187
    - rid: 268099911722205188
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Or, at the very least, you aren't.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: See, we're all characters from a game called Doki Doki Literature Club.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: It's a visual novel where-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205190
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205191
    - rid: 268099911722205192
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Everyone. Everything. None of it is real?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And Monika knows that, somehow?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... who is she, anyway?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: <i>I feel faint<i>...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I-if... if our lives are all just some game then...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Then...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: <Speed=2><NoiseText=3,1>You...</NoiseText></Speed>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205205
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It's <b>you</b>, isn't it?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: <b>You're</b> not just some voice...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: You're the player, aren't you?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: All of our lives, our struggles, tailor-made for <b>you</b>...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I would know, I'm no stranger to video games.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... you know what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Screw your fun.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I've got my own life to live.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Grk-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099911722205206
    - rid: 268099911722205207
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=3,1>{mc}, what are you doing</NoiseText>?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=5>I can see it now! The player's vessel, stuck inside me</SineText>!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} let''s not be too hasty-'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=5>Look Monika, it's got horns! Convenient for grabbing, no</SineText>?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099941463490560
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} no, they''re the only thing that matters-!'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <SineText=5>And that's the problem, isn't it</SineText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099941463490561
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: <SineText=5>You're feelin' pretty loose, whoever you are</SineText>.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: <SineText=5>Just one more yank and</SineText>-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099941463490562
    - rid: 268099941463490563
    - rid: 268099941463490564
    - rid: 268099941463490566
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Darn.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099941463490571
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: If I knew {mc} was going to crash out like that, I would've wiped his
      memory or something.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Sorry that we have to chat like this again.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: And it'll be the last chat we have.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: For this run, at least.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: See, uh, {mc} might've... completely shattered your vessel.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: The little dragon icon thingy; the one you control whenever they're in
      danger.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: 'That was something I sort of had to jury rig to make this whole Skyrim
      isekai work:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Being able to see through {mc}'s perspective is sort of inherent to the
      world of DDLC-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: But that's not the case in Skyrim; the eyes you would naturally be able
      to see through there would be the Last Dragonborn.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Not only that, Skyrim only ever lets you look through the eyes of the
      Dragonborn, never through another character.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: (Except in Vaermina's quest, but you're looking through the eyes of the
      Dragonborn looking through the eyes of an NPC's memories.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: So I had to make something that would let you specifically control {mc},
      while also being able to see in the perspectives of other characters.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: And as a fun little bonus I let Monika see you, mostly just for more
      fun meta moments.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: But I didn't really have much time to think through how best your vessel
      should operate-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Which is why I didn't really account for self-sabotage as a possible
      threat.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Although, self-sabotage might not be the right term since you didn't
      really do anything...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: 'If you''re wondering about how they''re doing without you:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki's still getting blood out of the carpet in Jorrvaskr...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori got the food and is having dinner with Yuri and Onmund, who they're
      talking to for the first time...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}''s marching down to Whiterun to go capture Odahviing, now with
      his own issues like the rest of them...'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: And Monika's sad.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: I...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: I think it might be best if I let her fate to your imagination.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: If you're really worried about her, you should probably try again.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Have you been saving frequently?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, who am I kidding, by now you should know to save often thanks to
      the potential... difficulty spikes.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: But also, you're playing Skyrim (in a way), it could crash at any moment!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Heh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, since I guess this is technically an ending, I'll give you New
      Game+.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Next time you should try working with Monika more.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Either that, or fully commit to taking charge of their lives.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: You've seen what {mc} does when his "bubble" bursts...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: See you later.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Although, it won't be me, it'll be a different me-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fdd5cfec9471d2f48a6134838a2b377b, type: 2}
    dialog: Whatever.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099941463490568
    - rid: 268099941463490570
    - rid: 268099941463490572
